cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "GLO-NCA: Global Context-Aware Neural Cellular Automata for Brain Tumor Segmentation"
abstract: >-
  A lightweight, global-context-aware Neural Cellular Automata (NCA) architecture
  for multi-modal 3D brain-tumor segmentation on BraTS. GLO-NCA V3 is a unified
  multi-level model (global 32^3, regional 96^3, fine 128^3) with learnable
  cross-level projections and learnable fusion, totalling 40,656 parameters.
type: software
